        "conclusion": "The clean fixture passes. Replacing pilots.json with facility-source-index.json while declaring semantic-projection also passes with zero failures. Declaring that same file honestly as source-index fails solely because no semantic projection was revealed. The role label, not the artifact's semantic function, currently satisfies the gate."
